node_modules/
.wrangler/
.dev.vars
.DS_Store
*.log

# public/ IS committed on purpose. It is the build output of tools/build.mjs and it is what
# gets deployed, so the deployed bytes are the reviewed bytes. Never hand-edit it; the build
# regenerates it and `npm run deploy` rebuilds before shipping.

# THE STORE IS data/accounts.json AND IT IS COMMITTED, since 8 Sep 2026, by the owner's
# decision: the laptop master is retired and this private repo is the store's only home,
# exactly as the old master committed the same file to its own private repo on 9 Aug 2026.
# Every OTHER copy of an accounts file is still refused, so a stray backup or export can
# never land here by accident. The build writes only the sanitised cut into public/data.js.
accounts.json
**/accounts.json
!data/accounts.json
*.accounts.json
backups/

